Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single night, the lonely young boy desperately wished he could stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, by some impossible miracle, his silent wish finally came true one ordinary afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He could suddenly freeze everything around him, including the pouring rain and frozen wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, wielding this extraordinary and absolute power made him feel like an invincible god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He cruelly used his incredible gift to win fights and effortlessly escape every painful problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But slowly and painfully, he began to notice a deeply terrifying and irreversible cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time he stopped time, someone he deeply loved mysteriously forgot a memory of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate to fix his tragic mistakes, he stopped time one final time and whispered softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not need a world that stops for me, I just want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He let time flow again, choosing to bravely grow older instead of living forever.
